versionEdits.description:
Tracks the version history of an object, which is only active if version history tracking is enabled. This field is
crucial for accessing previous versions of an object and is entirely managed by the system.

@see Ann.Db#versionHistory

observedAt.description:
When was this unique K8sResource observed.
Is equivalent to the last added {@link K8sManagedFieldsEntry#time} in the resource's {@link K8sObjectMeta}.
If {@link K8sObjectMeta#managedFields} is null then this is equivalent to {@link K8sObjectMeta#creationTime}
